General fixes:
- Fixed an issue where the scripted actions queue was overflowing, which could lead to the incorrect execution of the game's scenarios;
- Fixed issues with video playback when using discrete sound cards, which should eliminate the lag and crashes happening in the intro and outro;
- Fixed the UI image for the MLRS technical.

DLC:
- Fixed the scripting errors with the Grads in the second mission. We recommend restarting the mission instead of using the old saves from the mission;
- Fixed an issue where some allied troops didn't come under the player's control in the third mission;
- Slightly increased the SPG squad's accuracy and adjusted their growth with experience ranks;
- Fixed audio issues with the driver squad;
- Fixed a problem with aiming at one of the enemy T-72s in the fourth mission;
- Fixed the UI image for the B-10 technical.

