- easy difficulty added: compared to normal difficulty more command points are given and you can bring more infantry and vehicles on missions;
- package structure reworked to make further updates easier;
- the audio library was replaced in order to improve stability and fix a problem with launching the game;
- an additional Microsoft Visual C++ component (VCredist) is now being installed in order to fix a problem with launching the game on some hardware;
- minor fixes in the 4th mission scripts.

