We're happy to announce that the game is available for purchase again. During the period of abscence we've prepared an updated with fixes to known common issues:
- crashes on launch on some hardware;
- sound-related crashes in the main menu on some hardware;
- memory leaks and save/load-related crashes;
- save-corrupting errors;
- audio channels being inverted on certain camera angles;
- errors leading to second mission not being able to be completed in some cases (attention: don't use old saves from this mission, you have to start the mission from the global map);
and other minor errors.

And meet the new "Desert Hawks"-style gun truck with a ZU-23 twin-barreled autocannon installed on it!

